g cross-tenant enumeration (id=1,2,3,...) trivial. Disclosed columns are end-user PII: external_id, last_seen, props jsonb (init.sql:51-54). The omission is anomalous rather than intentional -- every comparable read scopes by tenant: same file line 31, filters.ts:100 on this same table, checklists.ts:27-29 for its /:id route, datasets/index.ts:105, analytics.ts:23, and runs/index.ts:207 which scopes /:id by org_id with an explicit comment about cross-project URL sharing. The advisory exploit_search was a no-op (corpus not indexed) and is inapplicable: this is first-party application code, not a versioned third-party dependency, so no patched-version rebuttal exists."
