ded control. Reachability: the graph marks this call reachable_from_entry=false, but it marks EVERY route in the file the same way (including evaluations.get(\"/\")), i.e. the known arrow-function under-linking artifact; I confirmed reach from source -- router mounted at v1/index.ts:44 and the frontend fetches /evaluations/result/${id} at frontend/pages/evaluations/[id].tsx:37 (also proving /:id at line 57 does not shadow it, since :id matches one segment). CORRECTION to the analyst: exploitation requires knowing the target evaluation UUID (uuid_generate_v4(), init.sql:322), which is not enumerable -- a real practical barrier the analyst omitted, so I rate this MEDIUM rather than HIGH. No versioned component is involved (custom authz logic), so exploit_search does not apply."
